{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 48 från SD.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 48 by SD.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "IT in schools", "dok_titel": "General school matters", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2023/24:370 by Patrick Reslow et al. (SD) demand 4,\n\n2023/24:1493 by Adnan Dibrani and Mattias Jonsson (both S),\n\n2023/24:2451 by Camilla Hansén et al. (MP) demand 22,\n\n2023/24:2482 by Muharrem Demirok et al. (C) demand 49, and\n\n2023/24:2489 by Niels Paarup-Petersen et al. (C) demand 8.", "notis": "The Riksdag said no to 135 proposals in motions on general school matters from the general motion period 2023. The reason is, among other things, current regulations and ongoing investigations.\nThe proposals deal, for example, with measures to improve knowledge results, the distribution of responsibility and resources in the school system, and independent schools.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2023/24:370 by Patrick Reslow et al. (SD) demand 4,\n\n2023/24:1493 by Adnan Dibrani and Mattias Jonsson (both S),\n\n2023/24:2451 by Camilla Hansén et al. (MP) demand 22,\n\n2023/24:2482 by Muharrem Demirok et al. (C) demand 49, and\n\n2023/24:2489 by Niels Paarup-Petersen et al. (C) demand 8.", "Reservation 48"]}, "votering_id": "01FFC8E1-A0DB-4BAB-BB16-EE521FDC33E9", "rm": "2023/24", "beteckning": "UbU9", "punkt": 24, "dok_id": "HB01UbU9", "datum": "2024-04-24", "utskott": "UbU", "rubrik": "It i skolan", "dok_titel": "Övergripande skolfrågor", "sammanfattning": "Utbildningsutskottet föreslår att riksdagen säger nej 